         <pdf:Keywords>http://dx.doi.org/10.1029/2005WR004590, doi:10.1029/2005WR004590, dielectric permittivity, electrical conductivity, fast Fourier transform, interfacial polarization, temperature, time domain reflectometry</pdf:Keywords>
